<p>RE: $28,500,000</p>
<p>CHAMPLAIN VALLEY PHYSICIANS HOSPITAL</p>
<p>MEDICAL CENTER</p>
<p>INSURED REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1997</p>
